self.KB_CONTENT["card:750105"]={"id":"card:750105","ty":"card","sourceId":"750105","title":"『自動付款作業』中的『選擇預計付款日 (ACP.TA019)』為何？","ver":"iGP","topic":"付款","keywords":["付款","預計","整批"],"y":"other","answer":"* 可點選(icon)或[F2]日期快手查詢，須整批自動轉付之預計付款日期區間。若空白表全部。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
